graph TD
    A[Image Input] --> B{Is HEIC/HEIF?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Convert to PNG<br/>heic-convert]
    B -- No --> D[Resize to 1024x1024<br/>sharp]
    C --> D
    D --> E[Detect Face<br/>SSD Mobilenet v1]
    E --> F[Extract Descriptor<br/>128D Vector]
    F --> G[Calculate Euclidean Distance<br/>vs Stored Descriptor]
    G --> H{Distance < Threshold?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Match]
    H -- No --> J[No Match]
